| The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy  |
| dog while the five boxing wizards jump   |
| quickly. Pack my box with five dozen     |
| liquor jugs; sphinx of black quartz,     |
| judge my vow. How vexingly quick daft    |
| zebras jump!                             |
| Supercalifragilisticexpialidocious words |
| must be broken somewhere.                |
